  "notes": [
    "Addresses are those of the manual; the address sent in the request is one less (address_base 1).",
    "Function 03 and 04 both read the measurements. 32- and 64-bit values are sent high word first.",
    "DMG610 and DMG615 have a built-in RS-485 port; DMG620 has Ethernet (Modbus TCP). DMG600 has no communication port.",
    "The model is reported by function 17 (Report Slave ID).",
    "Max (HI), min (LO), average and max demand values, harmonics, I/O and setup parameters (tables 4-8 of the manual) are not listed here."
